{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this short and dark adventure of \u201cCooking is Magic!\u201d, Camille awakens once more in the kitchen of a purgatory\u2019s restaurant. Hunger calls her again. Grotesque creatures knock on the door with orders\u2026 and she will have to take them. After all, a ritual must be served.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/c042d7a256235b893ce2fa06a1b84d37.avif?t=1774216855\" width=1600 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore your surroundings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ingredients on the kitchen tables or beyond the doors of the restaurant. Listen to the whispers and watch how the world changes through each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/b0d4be0705f24fb56e0eabcecac602b9.avif?t=1774216855\" width=1600 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles and cook</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each client brings a different order, and each dish requires attention and sacrifices. Match objects, watch clues and prepare recipes that should never be made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/205d4eb7fff828ee2fdc2121f0eeedc6.poster.avif?t=1774216855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/205d4eb7fff828ee2fdc2121f0eeedc6.webm?t=1774216855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/205d4eb7fff828ee2fdc2121f0eeedc6.mp4?t=1774216855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/190e24309d80be42f6fcb5c25d936462.avif?t=1774216855\" width=1600 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Know your customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures don`t ask only for food. They speak, watch and accuse. Each encounter is a piece of the ritual\u2026 and from a past that Camille tries to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/dbe73b940b74541515e23da18ee51e17.avif?t=1774216855\" width=1600 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark narrative with closed ending and a twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brief, enigmatic dialogues with grotesque creatures, each one with its own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original and immersive soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touch of irony and poetry in every line of dialogue.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Doll's eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832130/4b679fe5b00c7a4b9d0777cec9452027c81a4f65.jpg"},{"name":"Silence in the kitchen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832130/fb794e46b9881fc8a4aeacef455905aa2a477755.jpg"},{"name":"The entity wakes up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832130/18def7a3619e15bde8b624447f6e4eb889f735ee.jpg"},{"name":"Curious fly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832130/026da9e9c0de34d25b8e223f9dc2d27606e019ba.jpg"},{"name":"Who left this here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832130/ffe87e070d4f621178e663c42eff4357415b81a4.jpg"},{"name":"Did you feel hun