 >The creatures don`t ask only for food. They speak, watch and accuse. Each encounter is a piece of the ritual\u2026 and from a past that Camille tries to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/extras/dbe73b940b74541515e23da18ee51e17.avif?t=1774216855\" width=1600 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark narrative with closed ending and a twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brief, enigmatic dialogues with grotesque creatures, each one with its own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original and immersive soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touch of irony and poetry in every line of dialogue.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Last Rain"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832130/51dad2d4f5b5fa02ed334d43de176629323e9403/header.jpg?t=1774216855","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832130/144136840/a3463047c55daf4edcb12cc1a529d67d31eb6e33/1774216066/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774216854","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832130/144136840/a3463047c55daf4edcb12cc1a529d67d31eb6e33/1774216066/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774216854","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832130/144136840/a3463047c55daf4edcb12cc1a529d67d31eb6e33/1774216066/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774216854","id":257307519,"name":"Cooking is Magic! - Trailer de Lan\u00e7amento","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257307519/9e37555cf4f4f905705e5cf7669b473d3ca23ac5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=